WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
Qwen2.5-VL encodes the prompt and, for editing, the source image.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
The VAE encodes images into compact latent representations.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
MMDiT predicts velocity from the conditions and current latent.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
Iterate from noise, then decode the final latent into pixels.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
The semantic route interprets the edit; the VAE route supplies details.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
Understand conditions → represent images → predict velocity → decode.
